      "content": "okay i get the liver thing but im a big guy, like 220lbs, so i figure my tolerance is way higher than average. if i needed to take like 5000mg or 6000mg over a whole day just to get through this training phase, would that really be that bad? i feel like i need more than the standard dose to actually feel something.",
